NBT-AAD patch (2026-11-12, car-tested): video flow control and frame-rate limit, media status channel, media keys.
- AASession::setVideoAckGate / postVideoConsumed: a video frame is acked only after the decoder chain took it, so the phone
  never runs ahead of the stock player (it stalled and restarted every ~65 s before). NBT_AA_VIDEO_FPS limits the ack rate,
  NBT_AA_VIDEO_WINDOW the number of unacked frames (default 3 when paced).
- AASession::setMediaStatusCallback: playback status (0x8001) and track metadata with cover (0x8003) of channel 12.
- sdr_builder: NBT_SDR_MEDIA_KEYS=1 declares MEDIA_PLAY_PAUSE/NEXT/PREVIOUS/PLAY/PAUSE for the steering wheel keys.
Upstream: https://github.com/Sq00ky/Supra-iDrive6-Android-Auto commit 41975f2 (PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0).
Applies after scripts/aa_session_overlay.py and the patches whose names sort before this one; scripts/build_all.py does all.

